The '''Candy Relic''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Accessory]] that can be bought from the [[Fear Mongerer]] for {{Item|Candy Artifact|amount=1}} and {{Item|Purple Candy|amount=1024}}. It increases the chance of getting {{LI|Green Candy}} and {{LI|Purple Candy}} from mobs during the [[Spooky Festival]] by {{green|20%}}. It is the direct upgrade from the {{Item|Candy Artifact}} and is the final [[Accessory]] in the "Candy" line.

== Obtaining ==
=== Shop Purchase ===
It can be purchased from the [[Fear Mongerer]] during the [[Spooky Festival]] for {{Item|Candy Artifact|amount=1}} and {{Item|Purple Candy|amount=1024}}.

